-- `list_still_used` on `browser-inline`, whose chain says `"lists":
-- "in-place"` (`ownership-checker.md` §28.2): `check` runs the ownership
-- checker there, and `List.push xs n` followed by a read of `xs` is an
-- error. On a platform that edits nothing in place the module checks clean.
grownBy : List Int, Int → Int
grownBy xs n =
    ys = List.push xs n
    List.length ys + List.length xs
